			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Netochka"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760034015,
					"content": "Katya's cooking is amazing... Novokitezhgrad can wait a little longer.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034016,
						760034002,
						760034011
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760034016,
					"content": "Netochka, we meet again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034017
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760034017,
					"content": "Ah! Are you here for our duel? Th—This is a surprise attack! If we have to do it, at least schedule a time and place...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034018
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760034018,
					"content": "I'd still like to spend some quality time here. I mean, I haven't had the chance to explore Nasha Town proper... So how about we leave our showdown for later?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760034002,
					"content": "About Novokitezhgrad...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034003
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760034003,
					"content": "I felt stifled while I lived there, but now that I've left, I find myself missing it... This is the first time I've been so far from home.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760034004,
					"content": "I thought there would be plenty of fae living in other places too, like back home. Even Snezhnograd has its fair share of them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760034005,
					"content": "But then I ended up in Nod-Krai and haven't even seen a single one of them. Paimon also said she isn't fae. Hmm... It's got nothing to do with the climate here, right...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034013
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760034013,
					"content": "There's no snowstorms here, and you won't be left without options if you're caught without a stove in the wild.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034014
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760034014,
					"content": "Oh and, I even saw someone drinking liquor from Novokitezhgrad in Nod-Krai. We're known for our liquor industry as much as our mining industry, but still, seeing stuff from home makes me... sentimental?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760034011,
					"content": "See you around!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760034012
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760034012,
					"content": "Yeah! Until then, good luck to the both of us!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				}
			]
		},
