				},
				{
					"id": 760730106,
					"content": "About Raskolnikov...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760730107
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760730107,
					"content": "Ah, him... He used to be the best and favorite student of my father's. I guess he's made a name for himself now that he's with the Fatui?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760730108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760730108,
					"content": "I used to admire him too. I wanted to be like him... but I guess no matter how hard I try, I can never beat him.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760730109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760730109,
					"content": "Hmm, I used to think he didn't care about me at all, but this time I could feel his hostility. I wonder why?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760730110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760730110,
					"content": "And that comment about me being \"arrogant\"... No idea where that came from.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Netochka"
				},
				{
					"id": 760730111,
					"content": "See you around!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760730112
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 760730112,
